<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10337" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conjectūrālis</span></b> ,
		e, adj.
		conjectura, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>belonging to conjecture</i> or <i>guessing, conjectural</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ars medicina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 1 praef.</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">2, 6</span></i>
			<i>fin.</i>—Esp. freq. in rhet. lang.:
			causa, Cic.  Top. 24, 92: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">causae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 11, 50</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Quint. 2, 4, 26</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">status,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					3, 6, 29</span></i>
			; and <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-jectūrālĭa</span></b> ,
				ium, n., <i>conjectures</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">haec,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 7, 1, 53</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">4, 4,
				8</span></i>.—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conjec-tūrālĭter</span></b> , <i>conjeclurally, by conjecture</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nil conjecturaliter gestum, nil per ambages,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 8, 11 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			</div>
